		{
			title: "On the go"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&6So a backpack is all well and good while adventuring, but its not very Digital, right? Well, it is, its a game, but like...it's not DIGITAL digital, right?"
				""
				"&6Enter the Portable Grid. You can use it to access a Storage Disk you've brought with you. Slot it into the spot in the upper right, make sure the Portable Grid has some powered stored, and you are good to go!"
			]
			dependencies: ["719CA2564F0A01FA"]
